<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.carry.takes ~ the place's half of the carry

`lares nexus carry-take <bundle-file>` verifies every act of a carry bundle against the charter held for its Nexus, refuses a carry naming another key, and writes the acts and floor pins onto this vessel's own replica; the herm's floor gate stands there at the next refold.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ take

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`take` params=`file/carry.json ~ take a carry bundle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ file

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`file` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<bundle-file> ~ the carry bundle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes this vessel's own replica`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.carry.takes file/carry.json]] ~ name the bundle file`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the bundle reads unreadable, names another key, or fails verification`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ taken

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`taken` params=`exit/0 ~ the carry stands on this replica`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

